## Third-party components

This project depends on third-party software under separate licences. Those
licences apply to those components, not to this licence.

See [`docs/LICENSING.md`](docs/LICENSING.md) for the full inventory, including
one component (PyMuPDF, AGPL-3.0-or-commercial) whose use is confined to
build-time tools and flagged for review before distribution in any packaged
form.

Model weights are not distributed with this repository. `models/download_models.py`
fetches pinned files from their original sources under their own licences.

The corpus consists of public government publications of the Republic of the
Philippines — Republic Act No. 10173, its Implementing Rules and Regulations,
and issuances of the National Privacy Commission. Provenance and SHA-256 for
each document are recorded in `corpus/raw/fetch_manifest.json`.